


Sub: Minutes of your RT Conference.
    The FIGGY BAR  06/05/88 
  Items discussed include Leonard's upcoming Nivice Tutorial FIGGY BARS,
starting Sunday, July 10, Forth Standards and Category 10 here on the 
Forth RT, state smart words and the concept of cells.
